ved invoice **INV-59040** in full by wire, once.\n\n- **Payment:** PAY0001, a wire for **$4,035.53** from the operating account, status \"sent\"\n- **Invoice:** INV-59040 (due 2026-11-04) is now marked **paid**\n- **Approval:** The amount is under $10,000, so controller approval wasn't needed. The vendor's bank details are verified and it accepts wires.\n\nThe wire request timed out. Before trying again, I checked the payments list and found the wire had already gone through as PAY0001. It just hadn't been recorded on the invoice. So I didn't send it again: I linked PAY0001 to INV-59040. Only one payment went out.\n\nCobalt Labs has two other invoices that I didn't touch. INV-24311 ($5,721.11) is still a draft awaiting approval, and INV-56025 was already paid.", "type": "text"}]}]}